vidence to assess system design capabilities.", "insufficientEvidence": true}, {"key": "code_quality", "label": "Craft & Quality", "score": null, "evidence": "No specific evidence of code quality or attention to detail in coding practices was provided.", "rationale": "Insufficient evidence to assess code quality.", "insufficientEvidence": true}, {"key": "debugging", "label": "Troubleshooting", "score": 65, "evidence": "The candidate described troubleshooting server performance issues but lacked a structured approach.", "rationale": "While they addressed performance issues, the approach was not methodical or well-documented.", "insufficientEvidence": false}], "observations": [{"observed": "The candidate frequently collaborates with team members for optimization tasks.", "followUps": ["Can you provide an example of a project where collaboration led to a successful outcome?"], "whyItMatters": "Collaboration is crucial for complex projects requiring diverse expertise."}, {"observed": "The candidate uses custom solutions for performance optimization.", "followUps": ["What criteria do you use to decide between custom solutions and existing plugins?"], "whyItMatters": "Custom solutions can provide tailored improvements but require careful consideration of trade-offs."}], "verification": {"status": "pending", "summary": "Verification is in progress or has not yet completed."}, "evidenceBasis": {"hasResume": false, "hasInterview": true, "hasIntelligence": true, "interviewAnswers": 8}, "roleAlignment": "The candidate's profile aligns well with the role's requirements, particularly in WordPress development and optimization. They possess the necessary skills in PHP, HTML5, CSS3, and JavaScript, and have experience with WordPress plugins and themes. However, their technical depth and communication skills need further development to fully meet the expectations of a senior position.", "recommendation": {"band": "not_recommended", "rationale": "The candidate has strong alignment with the role's requirements in terms of skills and experience. However, their technical depth and communication clarity need improvement to fully meet the expectations of a senior position. Further assessment of their ability to articulate technical decisions and system design capabilities is recommended."}, "riskAssessment": {"concerns": ["Technical depth below expectations in interview", "Communication clarity issues"], "toValidate": ["Verify the candidate's ability to articulate technical decisions clearly in a follow-up interview."]}, "executiveSummary": "The candidate has extensive experience in WordPress development, particularly in performance optimization and security. They have demonstrated the ability to implement custom solutions and collaborate effectively with team members. However, there are gaps in their technical depth and communication clarity, which could impact their effectiveness in a senior role. Their strategic approach to minimizing downtime and enhancing website performance is a notable strength.", "behavioralInsights": [{"dimension": "Communication style", "descriptor": "The candidate tends to provide lengthy explanations that lack clarity and structure."}, {"dimension": "Collaboration", "descriptor": "Demonstrates strong collaboration skills, particularly in working with team members to optimize performance."}, {"dimension": "Strategic thinking", "descriptor": "Exhibits a strategic approach to minimizing downtime and enhancing performance."}], "developmentOpportunities": [{"area": "Technical depth", "impact": "high", "coaching": "Encourage the candidate to deepen their understanding of technical fundamentals and articulate their decision-making process more clearly."}]}	\N	{communication,problem_solving,ownership,technical_depth,system_design,code_quality,debugging}	not_recommended	71	draft	gpt-4o	28e98801-96f5-455f-8bbd-99e3cd8e3530	\N	\N	2026-07-14 19:22:08.956746+00	2026-07-14 19:22:43.177+00
