fe66e74a-6d0e-4793-b9a6-ca3ebf3e98f6	ef723649-db05-447b-a147-af1627c79857	464dc17e-8688-4d06-b217-a4f4f96aedec	General Interview — English (United States)	general	[{"id": "c225f5d4-3e7d-4b0d-bf4c-fa9d2c975d0a", "text": "Rasagna, can you describe a time at www.kgtiger.com when you resolved a challenging issue in a Java application? What was the problem and what steps did you take to fix it?", "order": 1, "category": "behavioral", "followUpPrompts": ["How did the resolution impact your team or project?", "What did you learn from this experience that you brought into future projects?"]}, {"id": "6a9e6773-c483-4b5f-b652-4e2aa5e95324", "text": "How do you leverage your experience with Spring Boot and Spring MVC to develop scalable applications, especially when integrating with microservices architectures?", "order": 2, "category": "competency", "followUpPrompts": ["Can you give an example of a project where these skills were crucial?", "How do these frameworks complement the use of OAuth2 and JWT in your applications?"]}, {"id": "3e023e6b-5e84-41ea-bc5c-1a93d3d2f1b4", "text": "In collaborating with cross-functional teams, how do you ensure new features are designed effectively using both back-end (Java) and front-end (JavaScript frameworks like React/Angular) technologies?", "order": 3, "category": "situational", "followUpPrompts": ["What strategies do you use to ensure smooth communication between back-end and front-end developers?", "How do you handle discrepancies or conflicts in design and implementation requirements?"]}, {"id": "a663666d-fcda-4660-bde9-3c74c4433dc1", "text": "Given your experience with AWS and Docker, how would you implement a CI/CD pipeline to streamline the deployment of your Java applications?", "order": 4, "category": "competency", "followUpPrompts": ["Can you discuss the role of Jenkins in this process?", "What best practices do you follow to ensure security and efficiency in the pipeline?"]}, {"id": "d45a0193-4ae8-4e35-afa1-45bee86c0161", "text": "Imagine you're tasked with improving the performance of an existing Java application that heavily relies on database interactions. How would your knowledge of SQL and different databases like Oracle, PostgreSQL, or MongoDB influence your approach?", "order": 5, "category": "situational", "followUpPrompts": ["What database optimization techniques do you find most effective?", "Have you had to transition a project from one database to another? What challenges did you face?"]}]	40	2026-06-21 16:41:55.263615	en-US	\N	\N
a61fde29-493a-47e1-9a52-b63695a850fc	ef723649-db05-447b-a147-af1627c79857	464dc17e-8688-4d06-b217-a4f4f96aedec	General Interview — English (United States)	general	[{"id": "fcf1f14e-2a97-4e7d-a8cf-aa5b92b8b3ef", "text": "Rasagna, based on your experience with Spring Boot and REST APIs, can you describe a challenging project where you applied these technologies to optimize application performance?", "order": 1, "category": "competency", "followUpPrompts": ["What specific performance issues did you encounter and how did you address them?", "How did you measure the success of your performance optimizations?"]}, {"id": "eae38f76-f55f-41ba-839d-9d51351b015f", "text": "In your current role at 713 broad acres rd, you likely work with cross-functional teams. Can you tell us about a time you successfully collaborated with such teams to implement a new feature using your Java expertise?", "order": 2, "category": "behavioral", "followUpPrompts": ["What role did you play in the feature implementation process?", "How did you ensure that the feature met both user and technical requirements?"]}, {"id": "5ff2da7e-3c3a-4df5-a2c4-d5a7c0e0597a", "text": "Given your familiarity with microservices and AWS, how would you approach architecting a scalable microservices-based application on AWS for our team?", "order": 3, "category": "situational", "followUpPrompts": ["What key considerations would you keep in mind regarding resource allocation and service efficiency?", "How would you address the security challenges associated with this architecture?"]}, {"id": "c825b817-afc6-4c75-bf57-0eea21ab517d", "text": "Can you discuss a situation where you had to quickly learn a new technology or tool to complete a project, and how did you apply it effectively?", "order": 4, "category": "behavioral", "followUpPrompts": ["What steps did you take to ensure your learning process was efficient and effective?", "How did integrating this new technology or tool impact the overall project outcome?"]}, {"id": 