 take to identify the problem?", "What was the outcome and how did it affect the project?"]}, {"id": "5b52009c-4696-4fed-ba82-f1189d15c652", "text": "Considering your expertise in Agile and Scrum methodologies, how have they influenced your software development process at XYZ Technologies?", "order": 6, "category": "competency", "followUpPrompts": ["How did Agile practices impact your team's productivity?", "Can you provide a specific example of a successful Agile project you led or contributed to?"]}, {"id": "effe8b29-ba7e-4993-bb67-4e5c992c406e", "text": "Imagine receiving a feature request that requires the integration of new Java frameworks. How would you go about evaluating and implementing these changes?", "order": 7, "category": "situational", "followUpPrompts": ["What factors would you consider crucial while evaluating the integration?", "How would you communicate these changes to your team and other stakeholders?"]}, {"id": "bd9d3e66-6442-44ac-8c58-70ed2fa2f68e", "text": "Reflect on your role in maintaining the software development lifecycle at your current company. What strategies did you employ to enhance this process?", "order": 8, "category": "behavioral", "followUpPrompts": ["Were there any modifications you proposed that had a major impact?", "How did these strategies improve overall team efficiency and product quality?"]}]	64	2026-07-01 21:31:47.738969	en-US	\N	\N
