 what benefits did you observe?", "order": 5, "category": "behavioral", "followUpPrompts": ["What role did you play in the Agile development process?", "Have you faced any obstacles when implementing Agile practices?"]}, {"id": "745c1a29-ac7e-4a92-9348-5439c6d3b9ac", "text": "Imagine you are tasked with enhancing the performance of a Java application. What strategies would you employ to identify and resolve potential bottlenecks?", "order": 6, "category": "situational", "followUpPrompts": ["How would you ensure changes do not adversely affect other application areas?", "What tools or techniques have you found most effective?"]}, {"id": "4fd5d952-9813-478e-b3bb-3581a0f88aef", "text": "With your extensive experience in REST APIs, how do you ensure their scalability and efficiency in your projects at XYZ Technologies?", "order": 7, "category": "competency", "followUpPrompts": ["Have you ever encountered issues with REST API integration? How did you address them?", "What criteria do you use to measure the success of a REST API you have developed?"]}, {"id": "c8c84759-56c9-4c6b-bc6b-3a07c53bf11d", "text": "Reflecting on your knowledge of Docker and Kubernetes, can you provide an example of how these tools have supported continuous integration and deployment processes in your current projects?", "order": 8, "category": "situational", "followUpPrompts": ["What specific challenges have you handled while integrating these tools?", "How have these tools improved the development workflow?"]}]	64	2026-07-01 21:33:16.015693	en-US	\N	\N
