de4cfe96-3cfb-43ba-9259-ddce2c9728e7	9019c3e3-271b-4720-af87-3d2ef5dc7827	6b758761-9348-481c-a8c7-aee8a05ddf04	General Interview — English (United States)	general	[{"id": "d2f5ad39-bb5d-4ae5-b7e7-67e7a2093f91", "text": "Can you describe a past project where you used ASP.NET and C# to overcome a complex problem? How did you approach the solution?", "order": 1, "category": "competency", "followUpPrompts": ["What was the outcome of the project?", "How did you ensure high code quality during this project?"]}, {"id": "b12a2f8e-724b-4c77-96ee-1ba5f20c3eb8", "text": "Tell us about a time you had to collaborate with a cross-functional team to deliver a feature. How did you manage differing perspectives?", "order": 2, "category": "behavioral", "followUpPrompts": ["What role did you play in the team?", "How did the feature impact the final product?"]}, {"id": "e997c828-1a5b-4ad3-b98a-ea91f3daa528", "text": "How do you stay updated with the latest .NET trends and technologies, and how have you applied them to a recent project?", "order": 3, "category": "competency", "followUpPrompts": ["Can you give a specific example of a trend you've implemented?", "What resources do you find most useful for staying updated?"]}, {"id": "d9c1a09b-a14a-46ec-84df-e7adfbfcdf33", "text": "Imagine you encounter a performance issue in a .NET application you've developed. What steps would you take to identify and fix the problem?", "order": 4, "category": "situational", "followUpPrompts": ["What tools would you use to diagnose the issue?", "How would you ensure the issue does not recur?"]}, {"id": "b7bfba6f-07ca-4a8e-9606-8ddf4a6b63e2", "text": "Describe a situation where you had to troubleshoot a challenging bug in a SQL Server database. What process did you follow?", "order": 5, "category": "competency", "followUpPrompts": ["What tools did you use during troubleshooting?", "How did you ensure the solution was robust and comprehensive?"]}, {"id": "a948c433-fd53-4732-b5e2-c5dfed6a9ef2", "text": "Have you had experience working in a hybrid work environment before? How did you ensure effective communication and collaboration?", "order": 6, "category": "behavioral", "followUpPrompts": ["What tools did you use to facilitate communication?", "How did this work environment impact your productivity?"]}, {"id": "f1ddbdb5-72b7-4143-abe6-def6a2c747fb", "text": "How would you approach a situation where a newly deployed application module led to unexpected errors in production?", "order": 7, "category": "situational", "followUpPrompts": ["What immediate actions would you take to minimize impact?", "How would you communicate with stakeholders during this process?"]}, {"id": "e248de12-f4d4-4b85-bbe0-c29e4d83f93f", "text": "Discuss a time when you successfully optimized a .NET application for better performance. What changes did you implement?", "order": 8, "category": "competency", "followUpPrompts": ["What were the performance metrics before and after optimization?", "How did you ensure the changes were sustainable?"]}]	64	2026-07-09 21:49:31.937698	en-US	\N	\N
da4bdb31-1ab8-4299-999d-480676578bf6	9019c3e3-271b-4720-af87-3d2ef5dc7827	6b758761-9348-481c-a8c7-aee8a05ddf04	Technical Interview — English (United States)	technical	[{"id": "abd3d7f8-d509-4e7b-8b19-0e641b9b5fb4", "text": "Given your role as an IT Head at LINX INC., how do you approach designing the architecture of a scalable .NET application that integrates with multiple database systems like MSSQL and MySQL as mentioned in your profile? What considerations do you take into account when ensuring data consistency across these databases?", "order": 1, "category": "technical", "followUpPrompts": ["Can you discuss how you would manage connection pooling and transaction management in such a multi-database setup?", "What strategies would you employ to handle data migrations or schema changes in this architecture?"]}, {"id": "c2a2450d-2791-4a2e-93a1-64989b675d34", "text": "Considering your experience with performance tuning and optimization, what techniques would you employ to optimize a .NET application running in an Azure environment for both performance and cost-effectiveness?", "order": 2, "category": "technical", "followUpPrompts": ["How would you leverage Azure's monitoring and analytics tools to identify performance bottlenecks?", "What role does caching play in your optimization strategy, and how would you implement it in the context of a cloud application?"]}, {"id": "d362c172-d0f3-4894-bef1-18fa3c05267b", "text": "In your view, what are the trade-offs between using Entity Framework (EF) Core and traditional ADO.NET for data access in a high-transactional .NET application?", "order": 3, "category": "technical", "followUpPrompts": ["Can you discuss scenarios where you would opt for EF Core over ADO.NET, and why?", "How do you handle situations where EF Core's performance might not meet application requirements?"]}, {"id": "4b0e8069-ccc2-4f43-848e-12f425bb7e0d", "text": "Describe a time when you had to debug a complex .NET application issue. What approach did you 