464dc17e-8688-4d06-b217-a4f4f96aedec	ef723649-db05-447b-a147-af1627c79857	Java Developer	Engineering	Telangana, India	remote	full_time	80000	120000	**Job Description: Java Developer**\n\n**Department:** Engineering  \n**Location:** Telangana, India  \n**Work Arrangement:** Remote  \n**Employment Type:** Full-time  \n**Salary:** ₹80,000 – ₹120,000  \n\n---\n\n**About the Role**\n\nWe are seeking a dedicated and experienced Java Developer to join our dynamic engineering team. In this role, you will design, develop, and maintain high-performance applications that enhance our product offerings. You will play a crucial part in solving complex challenges and driving our continuous innovation.\n\n**What You'll Do**\n\n- Develop, test, and deploy scalable and efficient Java applications.\n- Collaborate with cross-functional teams to define, design, and ship new features.\n- Identify and resolve application-related issues promptly to ensure optimal system performance.\n- Write and maintain clean, maintainable, and well-documented code.\n- Participate in code reviews to maintain code quality and share knowledge with your team.\n- Stay updated with emerging technologies and industry trends to continually enhance development processes.\n- Contribute to all phases of the development lifecycle and support application improvement initiatives.\n\n**What We're Looking For**\n\n- **Must-Have:** Bachelor's degree in Computer Science, Engineering, or a related field.\n- **Must-Have:** Proven experience as a Java Developer, with a strong grasp of Java ecosystems.\n- **Must-Have:** Proficiency in front-end technologies such as HTML, CSS, and JavaScript.\n- **Nice-to-Have:** Experience with cloud platforms (AWS, Azure, etc.) and microservices architecture.\n- **Nice-to-Have:** Familiarity with Agile methodologies and version control systems (e.g., Git).\n- **Nice-to-Have:** Excellent problem-solving skills and the ability to work independently.\n\n**Why Join Us**\n\n- Engage with an innovative team dedicated to pushing the boundaries of technology in a supportive and collaborative environment.\n- Experience the flexibility of remote work while participating in a culture that values growth, diversity, and inclusion.\n- Enjoy a competitive salary and opportunities for professional development and career advancement.\n\nJoin us in shaping the future of technology with your expertise and passion as part of our robust engineering team.	active	2026-06-21 14:11:18.654868	2026-06-21 14:11:18.654868	WO-2026-TAF-MAIN-0001	\N	28e98801-96f5-455f-8bbd-99e3cd8e3530	ai	\N	en-US	f	\N	\N	\N	\N	f	f	\N	\N
0e1d6650-d96c-474b-81de-a5730d65a12d	43927d5b-5204-4816-8557-3f62a6c15d96	Sr. WordPress Developer	IT	New York, New York, United States	hybrid	full_time	5000	10000	**Sr. WordPress Developer**\n\n**Department:** IT  \n**Location:** New York, New York, United States  \n**Work Arrangement:** Hybrid  \n**Employment Type:** Full-time  \n**Salary:** $5,000 – $10,000 USD  \n\n---\n\n**About the Role**  \nWe are seeking a highly skilled, passionate Sr. WordPress Developer to join our dynamic IT team in New York. This role involves both front-end and back-end development, designing and managing our WordPress websites to ensure optimal performance and user experience. As a key member of our team, you'll play a crucial role in elevating our digital presence.\n\n**What You'll Do**  \n- Develop and customize WordPress themes and plugins to meet project requirements, ensuring a seamless user experience.\n- Collaborate with designers, marketers, and other developers to bring creative concepts to reality.\n- Optimize website performance, ensuring high-speed load times and adherence to best SEO practices.\n- Troubleshoot and resolve website and server issues, maintaining site integrity and security.\n- Implement and maintain integrations with third-party services and APIs.\n- Stay updated with the latest industry trends, tools, and technologies to ensure we leverage cutting-edge solutions.\n- Provide technical guidance and mentorship to junior developers within the team.\n\n**What We're Looking For**  \n- **Must-have:** Proven experience (5+ years) in developing WordPress sites, including proficiency in PHP, HTML5, CSS3, and JavaScript.\n- **Must-have:** Strong experience with WordPress plugins, the theme ecosystem, and template hierarchy.\n- **Must-have:** Familiarity with front-end technologies like React or Vue.js.\n- **Nice-to-have:** Experience with multilingual sites and internationalization.\n- **Nice-to-have:** Understanding of modern build tools like Webpack or Gulp.\n- Excellent problem-solving skills and the ability to work independently and as part of a team.\n\n**Why Join Us**  \n- **Innovation-Driven Environment:** Work in a cutting-edge tech environment where creativity and new ideas are encouraged and rewarded.\n- **Career Advancement:** Opportunities for professional growth and mentorship in a supportive and collaborative team.\n- **Comprehensive Benefits:** We offer a competitive salary range and a comprehensive benefits package to ensure a healthy work-life balance.\n\nJoin us and be part of a team where your expertise creates a tangible impact on our online success. We're excited to meet innovators who push boundaries and redefine our digital landscape.	active	2026-07-14 16:37:54.831311	2026-07-14 16:37:54.831311	WO-2026-LINX-MAIN-0004	\N	28e98801-96f5-455f-8bbd-99e3cd8e3530	ai	\N	en-US	f	\N	\N	\N	\N	f	f	\N	\N
a42d39af-e033-44ff-8ed6-dc64f42fd811	43927d5b-5204-4816-8557-3f62a6c15d96	Senior Recruiter			hybrid	full_time	\N	\N	**Job Description: Senior Recruiter**\n\n**About the Role**  \nWe are seeking an experienced and dynamic Senior Recruiter to join our team in a hybrid work arrangement. As a pivotal player in our talent acquisition strategy, you will be responsible for identifying, attracting, and hiring exceptional talent to support our company's growth and success. This role offers the opportunity to collaborate closely with hiring managers and develop innovative sourcing strategies.\n\n**What You'll Do**  \n- Partner with hiring managers to understand their staffing needs and develop effective recruiting strategies.\n- Source potential candidates through online channels (e.g., social platforms and professional networks) to build a strong talent pipeline.\n- Lead the full recruitment cycle from job posting to offer negotiation, ensuring a positive experience for all candidates.\n- Conduct interviews, assessments, and screenings to evaluate candidate qualifications and fit within our company culture.\n- Collaborate with the HR team to enhance employer branding strategies and engage top talent.\n- Stay up-to-date with industry trends and best practices to continuously refine our recruiting processes.\n- Mentor and guide junior recruiters, fostering a culture of continuous learning and improvement.\n\n**What We're Looking For**  \n- Proven experience as a recruiter, with at least 5 years in a similar role (Must-have).\n- Strong understanding of recruitment best practices and sourcing tools (Must-have).\n- Excellent communication and negotiation skills (Must-have).\n- Experience with Applicant Tracking Systems (ATS) and HR databases (Nice-to-have).\n- Ability to work independently and manage multiple priorities in a fast-paced environment (Must-have).\n- Bachelor’s degree in Human Resources, Business Administration, or a related field (Nice-to-have).\n\n**Why Join Us**  \n- Be part of a collaborative and inclusive environment that values innovation and professional growth.\n- Access to a supportive team that encourages work-life balance through flexible work arrangements.\n- Contribute to impactful projects that shape the future of our organization and industry. \n\nJoin us and play a key role in building a high-performing team that drives our continued success.	active	2026-07-20 15:45:43.178816	2026-07-20 15:48:22.271	WO-2026-LINX-MAIN-0005	\N	28e98801-96f5-455f-8bbd-99e3cd8e3530	ai	\N	es-PE	f	bed95f9a-b330-4676-bd50-a0d44de47a26	\N	\N	\N	f	f	\N	\N
